{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/mage-the-ascension/1081735-life-3","id":1081735,"title":"Life 3","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Mage: The Ascension"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-04-21T00:07:45-07:00","id":1081735,"title":"Life 3","content":"Can you like force someone's heart to stop beating with life 3?<br /> Thanks in advance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12133-leonardo","name":"Leonardo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"116"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-21T02:20:51-07:00","id":1081755,"title":"","content":"If you deal four successes worth of damage (eight health levels), then yes. It's even easier, considering Life damage is Aggravated and tends to ignore armor (depending on the exact Effect).<br /> <br /> If you deal fewer health levels of damage than it would take to kill outright, you might give them a severe but non-fatal heart attack. Of course, that depends on whether the exact thing you want to do is &quot;Stop Heart Completely&quot;, rather than &quot;Give Heart Attack&quot;. If it's the former, and depending on the character's Focus, the Storyteller may decide that it's all or nothing. The Effect has a four success minimum, and if that threshold isn't met, the Effect fails outright.<br /> <br /> So...make sure player and storyteller have this point hashed out ahead of time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters/15862327\" target=\"_blank\">Magestuck: The Ascension</a></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6156-bluecho","name":"Bluecho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6156_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3871"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-04-21T08:04:21-07:00","id":1081843,"title":"","content":"Even if it is ruled as all or nothing, there is still the rule of partial success.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>So, this Zen Master walks up to a hot dog stand and says: &quot;Make me one with everything!&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12022-nonsense","name":"Nonsense","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12022_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"815"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}